# Notices

This repository is intended to integrate with `rlottie` as a native rendering backend.

`rlottie` is developed by Samsung and distributed from:

https://github.com/Samsung/rlottie

Telegram iOS uses a Telegram fork that adds animated-sticker behavior including Fitz modifier support:

https://github.com/TelegramMessenger/rlottie

The current repository does not vendor `rlottie` source or commit binary artifacts. Binary releases generated by `scripts/build-rlottie-xcframework.sh` include Telegram's `rlottie` fork inside `TGSPlayerKitRLottieNative.xcframework`.

Before publishing a GitHub Release, include the upstream `rlottie` `COPYING` file and `licenses/COPYING.*` files from the exact source revision used to build the binary artifact.

Telegram animated sticker format information is documented by Telegram at:

https://core.telegram.org/stickers
